## 🔧 Local Development

### **Setup**

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/MrGweeod/mlb-agent.git
cd mlb-agent

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Set environment variables
export DATABASE_URL="postgresql://..."
export SPORTSGAMEODDS_API_KEY="..."
export BEARER_TOKEN="..."

# Run pipeline once
python main.py

# Start web server
python -m src.web.server
```

### **Run Tests**

```bash
# Test simple scorer
python test_simple_scorer.py

# Test coverage calculation
python -c "from src.engine.coverage import calculate_coverage; print(calculate_coverage(...))"

# Test parlay builder
python -c "from src.engine.parlay_builder import build_hybrid_parlays; print(build_hybrid_parlays(...))"
```

